<h1><span lang="EN-GB">Median Noise Reduction - Polylines</span></h1>
<hr align="left" width="98.974%" size="6" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Polylines &gt; Reduce Noise &gt; Median</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="Description"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">Median Noise Reduction</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command reduces noise by applying a median filter to the visible selected polylines. Spikes and isolated peaks in the data will be removed but critical features will be preserved. It modifies the selection by removing outlying (noisy) data. This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden. It works on wholly selected polylines as well as on partial selection.</span></p>
<p class="Normal"><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="../Commands_files/image369.jpg" width="299px" height="198px" border="0" class="img_whs4" alt=""></span></p>
<p class="parameterstitle"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Median filter size</b></span></p>
<p class="parameterdescription"><span lang="EN-GB">Specifies the area over which filter operates. It ranges from 1 to 10. Default filter size is 1.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP175003303" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs5">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs6">
<td class="whs7">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="processing_polylines_files/image006.jpg" width="301px" height="196px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs9">
<p><span lang="EN-GB"><img src="processing_polylines_files/image052.jpg" width="301px" height="196px" border="0" class="img_whs8" alt=""></span></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs6">
<td class="whs10">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Polyline before applying Median filter</span></p>
</td>
<td class="whs11">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">Polyline after applying Median filter</span></p>
</td>
