<p><span lang="EN-GB">Poor surface finish, direct reflections or using incorrect laser power setting may cause noise in the data, which later reflects to the polylines.</span></p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Median Noise Reduction</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to remove any outlying (noisy) data in the polylines.</span></p>
<p class="Normal" style="text-align:justify;"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Related topic:</b></span> <u style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a href="average_noise_reduction_-_polylines.htm">Average Noise Reduction</a></span></u></p>
